5. Bring a large pot of[ sal]ted water to a[ boil]. Add ravioli and cook until tender, 2-3 minutes. To serve, reheat the browned butter. Drain ravioli and place in warmed serving bowl. Toss with butter, sprinkle with[ haz]el[nuts] and 1/4 cup[ Parmesan]

