> After a hot hot hot spruce[ bath] and some linden/elder[flower infusion] I find myself in bed, floating through worlds, my bones burning and my mind drfiting up and up. Alternating between hot and cold with one sock[ halfway] off I am[ dreaming] and[ tossing] about,[ waking] occasionally to feebly reach for water or a lymphatic t[incture].
